  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "冊子帶來了恐怖。",
      "output_sha256": "3544d02678d200519ac225a064086952aaf672f0f14c08aa2cb4e1eda8542ec4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "3544d02678d200519ac225a064086952aaf672f0f14c08aa2cb4e1eda8542ec4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "黃昏時候，我們排完了劇，和劇團那些人出了“民衆教育館”，恐怖使我對於家有點不安。",
      "output_sha256": "97de5e5a28796e5bb3e70a04585454ba9d410d71a61d806881f63e0bfceb399f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "97de5e5a28796e5bb3e70a04585454ba9d410d71a61d806881f63e0bfceb399f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "街燈亮起來，進院，那些人跟在我們後面。",
      "output_sha256": "b9e835abeba08daf0588c98c0c9f81f34ff6b929ca1c35158abb8f00ee963eb3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "b9e835abeba08daf0588c98c0c9f81f34ff6b929ca1c35158abb8f00ee963eb3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "門扇和窗戶，和平常一樣安靜地關閉著。",
      "output_sha256": "e459a23d1de61af575dd46249a0832df8eb29bddab219041718f00e9a2c9b74e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.52,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "106f1313bc323f6a62467cebd0651344510da1a3315b6b625d67ce7626a05c08"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e459a23d1de61af575dd46249a0832df8eb29bddab219041718f00e9a2c9b74e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我心中稍感安慰，明白家中並未有任何邪物造訪。",
      "output_sha256": "92135989d0cfad211c7226c6ac3e0d41f5fdb13cd43e4fe3fc55f70294cb9dac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.349769,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c3116b2772320fcee74f4602be1fb81ac08cf2d915fbbfd642e3c606ff51d59f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "92135989d0cfad211c7226c6ac3e0d41f5fdb13cd43e4fe3fc55f70294cb9dac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "失望了，開門的鑰匙由郎華帶着，於是大家只好坐在窗下的樓梯口。",
      "output_sha256": "0f5c12c171a8b724d931ca75dda591f411c84f8763219ea7cc148016abff500d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "0f5c12c171a8b724d931ca75dda591f411c84f8763219ea7cc148016abff500d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "李買的香瓜，大家就吃香瓜。",
      "output_sha256": "9aa363fc0ddbc811743f4fa95c07a499825a54addae0ac1749403a07cc0d6e32",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "9aa363fc0ddbc811743f4fa95c07a499825a54addae0ac1749403a07cc0d6e32",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "汪林照樣吸着煙。",
      "output_sha256": "0f2a806ac5b92dc04529c6690e9620850bc0ef98bbf38d460414963f8c18b9db",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "0f2a806ac5b92dc04529c6690e9620850bc0ef98bbf38d460414963f8c18b9db",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "她掀起紗窗簾向我們這邊笑了笑。",
      "output_sha256": "98c0d31c2b9f7e342e669a4ad21565e7ecd1915f9055ada24863a5f078144475",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "98c0d31c2b9f7e342e669a4ad21565e7ecd1915f9055ada24863a5f078144475",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "陳成舉起一個香瓜。",
      "output_sha256": "7cc9286692f0e64121cb3e4da987be54f078a53bc6f338e792a8429e0cdb48c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.579665,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f43c01ec2060ae37680c5698c41cd6a9fde1e2017213a9141261fe69737efafd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7cc9286692f0e64121cb3e4da987be54f078a53bc6f338e792a8429e0cdb48c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“不要。”",
      "output_sha256": "9540248f1ede3b0abe32289f9c1c0a64e14abc5062893e5156858663d879be74",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "9540248f1ede3b0abe32289f9c1c0a64e14abc5062893e5156858663d879be74",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "她搖頭，隔着玻璃窗說。",
      "output_sha256": "277fdcbd8d2e79a030d3dc3a4a352b1438d1b2ba283ae2362510aab1a798259f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "277fdcbd8d2e79a030d3dc3a4a352b1438d1b2ba283ae2362510aab1a798259f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我一點趣味也感不到，一直到他們把公演的事情議論完，我想的事情還沒停下來。",
      "output_sha256": "046b30ddb58706dfd3fd4dfacb7cc61bfc67bec907bf6588e56de79403a03c84",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "046b30ddb58706dfd3fd4dfacb7cc61bfc67bec907bf6588e56de79403a03c84",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我希望他們能快點離去，好讓我收拾箱子，仿佛箱子裡藏著什麼能使我和郎華犯罪的東西。",
      "output_sha256": "bd67e85e9175c8e68858771b832a183eff908e6dd2388d81489dc72436e98ad0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.60493,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "982679ef2dfc3e6a54b27786c5467c89025aab7a380e852a6b93e36ee0d900d2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bd67e85e9175c8e68858771b832a183eff908e6dd2388d81489dc72436e98ad0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那些人走了，郎華從牀底把箱子拉出來，洋燭立在地板上，我們開始收拾了。",
      "output_sha256": "b4f58788f7af9040d0391aae2eb0c532c6ce7f52e7339e2f4248d8461b6377fb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "b4f58788f7af9040d0391aae2eb0c532c6ce7f52e7339e2f4248d8461b6377fb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "弄了滿地紙片，什麼犯罪的東西也沒有。",
      "output_sha256": "aa5a83c8293ed83567922197ef3b35884dc89573d2effe3b640460b8ec2949ad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "aa5a83c8293ed83567922197ef3b35884dc89573d2effe3b640460b8ec2949ad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "但我卻不敢完全放心，擔心書頁中夾著罵“滿洲國”的字句，因此每本書我都翻了一遍。",
      "output_sha256": "15398a7a98675abcfb94aef8bdef6a47030724cf954c1b1247fe74243c711312",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.52604,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "68163351dc9c6b64a2fb773f300afacf346ce485bad43a7d15b3d3259dbe3ed6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "15398a7a98675abcfb94aef8bdef6a47030724cf954c1b1247fe74243c711312",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一切收拾好，箱子是空空洞洞的了。",
      "output_sha256": "f11303ed5acacc97f40f19c8d6cddc7d343ed0e55a65cc7882b58739d671766b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "f11303ed5acacc97f40f19c8d6cddc7d343ed0e55a65cc7882b58739d671766b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我還把一張高爾基的照片燒掉，火爐的火焰烤得臉頰發燙。",
      "output_sha256": "5b12ce90aff98c96faed3af8f7370b910ca288b81c0f3cb06cd158a93bfb7bb0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.541723,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19,
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e8de05d2758e2cc8395917809dcf32eb71dd9f7c2103f6684eb8f256d0b35253",
        "76dcc42d687acf59d89d9c67870c9d9c53836ca9c5645e0c89673fbf617b9060"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5b12ce90aff98c96faed3af8f7370b910ca288b81c0f3cb06cd158a93bfb7bb0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我燒得很快，日本憲兵就要來捉人似的。",
      "output_sha256": "eb3777eff6e615f014f1e78e2c5c9aca9e36e5c9c7561da057aba41a46f11350",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "eb3777eff6e615f014f1e78e2c5c9aca9e36e5c9c7561da057aba41a46f11350",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "當我們坐下來喝茶的時候，當然是十分定心了，十分有把握了。",
      "output_sha256": "cd3f029b8d71b19f59fc77bc1837e7d5e2aaf81c6f0222d0328bd3c72ec5143a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "cd3f029b8d71b19f59fc77bc1837e7d5e2aaf81c6f0222d0328bd3c72ec5143a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我無意中把一張吸墨紙玩弄在手，挺直了腰，裝出大方的樣子，心裡的緊張感似乎也隨之放鬆。",
      "output_sha256": "c965d6569d0dcc41874e0bde006f63bdee3305c9cec1b873dc32ec10b5bbce57",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.428051,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "41f1f352c075ecaaa5bb328a5d86dab0feaa969725fc8d6f0f4052686d04c0b0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c965d6569d0dcc41874e0bde006f63bdee3305c9cec1b873dc32ec10b5bbce57",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我仔細端詳著紅鉛筆在吸墨紙上寫的字，那些字正是違法的字句：",
      "output_sha256": "abca6f6260c95e1c817f9eb6fa366376932566a747423f434f0b4bb5d72ed889",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.690794,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "78821ba20e4fc04e52ee8aeb708399ba3b441dd22311259668c21e4a948da3f9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "abca6f6260c95e1c817f9eb6fa366376932566a747423f434f0b4bb5d72ed889",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "——小日本子，走狗，他媽的“滿洲國”……",
      "output_sha256": "250de669a8f6fca7f6d324d6b32badae3b5ff70da6cbf8f8af913d9703e71678",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "250de669a8f6fca7f6d324d6b32badae3b5ff70da6cbf8f8af913d9703e71678",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我連再看一遍也沒有看，就送到火爐裏邊。",
      "output_sha256": "40c28f006c9d0765295310175ba4685408ed83b6dfcb052b47341ecb8b9088b8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "40c28f006c9d0765295310175ba4685408ed83b6dfcb052b47341ecb8b9088b8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“吸墨紙啊！",
      "output_sha256": "217c8fd30ad9b79e62414ffa6b3826e7e440d5b37b8fed0cff405c7280610a20",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "217c8fd30ad9b79e62414ffa6b3826e7e440d5b37b8fed0cff405c7280610a20",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "是吸墨紙！”",
      "output_sha256": "26b2d158d24e18d3df0ffd1394e7bdd5320e4e3247842b72cdcc3c01878a00e1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "26b2d158d24e18d3df0ffd1394e7bdd5320e4e3247842b72cdcc3c01878a00e1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "郎華在旁不斷跺腳。",
      "output_sha256": "b161116debf343b02b23a2c3d1531df593bc9d387c814e18357a01b4a7811d8e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.473077,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
