      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a1b4350b661f4ea7463e91ca906eb9815cf362364aacb9e9ed6f2602b5275e86"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b161116debf343b02b23a2c3d1531df593bc9d387c814e18357a01b4a7811d8e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "等他發現那張紙已開始燃燒：“那麼大一張的吸墨紙你燒掉了，真是浪費！",
      "output_sha256": "c13fd3b5c816439e41d8664a37f0e34660d17785e1ee0843ff4e1e0b8fc15c34",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.593103,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "eda4f340a46d860a27a59a2419f55b0e6ab47f021ccc60da7d27e24385c849d2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c13fd3b5c816439e41d8664a37f0e34660d17785e1ee0843ff4e1e0b8fc15c34",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "什麼都燒，看你還能用什麼！”",
      "output_sha256": "86828daf7d26fa9411d2221f12a9db53519bbf30851feadc26f26f68119844ca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.699402,
